, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le11ob02re6aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "of his father.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 2}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "He started chanting ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le11ob02re6aud11", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "a magical prayer, hoping that the beautiful girl would return.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 3}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nThe son of the lake has gone crazy!\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Listen to the audio.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Type in the missing words. </span><span class=\"bullet\"> Use capital letters where necessary.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 9, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le11ob02re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nResearch the North American sweat lodge.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le11ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le11ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le11ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn10le11ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "From far and wide, the beauty of the chief's daughter was known to all. The finest young men had asked for her hand in marriage but no one was good enough for the chief's daughter.\nA young dreamer living in the village had fallen in love with the prized maiden. Each day he imagined how it would be to live with her forever, but he had always been too shy to approach her. Not only was he poor, but he also had scars on his face and was known as Scarface.\nOne day, the young man dreaming of marriage, gathered up all his courage and went to ask the chief's daughter if she would be his wife. When he got to her tent, the girl was doing beadwork. The boy was very nervous.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn10le11ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "\"Oh, beautiful maiden, will you have me for your husband?\" he stammered.\nThe girl had looked up from her beadwork. \"You?\" She laughed. \"Why would I want to marry you? What can someone like you give me?\"\nScarface was so humiliated that he turned and ran away. He ran until he could go no further. Lonely and exhausted, he curled up on the ground and let his eyelids close.\nPeeking through the clouds, the son of Moon and Sun caught sight of the unhappy man sleeping. Within a moment, Morning Star, as Sun and Moon's son was known, had descended to earth and carried Scarface up into the sky.", "id": 2, "time": "44000"}, {"image": "engenn10le11ob02re2img03.jpg", "text": "Morning Star built a sweat lodge. When he had completed it, he brought hot coal and a stick into the lodge, and Sun and Scarface went inside.\nSun had laid some sweet grass on the coal, and a sweet smell rose into the air as the grass began to burn. Sun chanted a prayer and cleansed the boy's face. After performing this ritual four times, Sun led Scarface out of the lodge. What do you think Morning Star saw? A young man who looked just like him, with long, yellow hair had no scars on his face! Even Morning Star's mother could not tell them apart.", "id": 3, "time": "89000"}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Culture, Myths, and Legends", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Sweat Lodge", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "  Describe detailed facts about events or actions in work and social contexts, in written or spoken situations", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.  ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Past Perfect Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Past Perfect tense:<br/> <ol><li>To talk about a completed action before something else in the past.</li><li>To explain or give a reason for something in the past.</li><li>As part of the third conditional.</li><ol>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The structure of the Past Perfect is:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "subject + had + past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">He <span class=\"strong\">had </span>always <span class=\"strong\">been</span> too shy to approach her.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The finest young men had asked for her hand in marriage but no one was good enough for the chief's daughter.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Each day he imagined how it would be to live with her forever, but he had always been too shy to approach her. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The girl had looked up from her beadwork.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Morning Star, as Sun and Moon's son was known, had descended to earth and carried Scarface up into the sky.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sun had laid some sweet grass on the coal, and a sweet smell rose into the air.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Look at these examples in the chart:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Use</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To talk about a completed action before something else happened\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Charlie had already done his homework when Tina called. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First, Charlie did the homework, then Tina called. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To explain or give a reason for something in the past  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He had drunk a glass of water, then he wasn't thirsty.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He drank a glass of water, after that, he was not thirsty.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"As part of the third conditional       \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If Clarice had known I was in town, she would have visited me. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Clarice did not know I was in town, so she did not visit me.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Participle Clause: Present Participle", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use a participle clause to give your reader more information about a noun in your sentence. The participle clause comes immediately after the noun it talks about.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The participle clause can also be referred to as a reduced clause, as the conjunction and verb 'to be' have been removed, shortening the clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "That man <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">standing over there </span> is my boss.</span><br/>(= The man who is standing over there is my boss.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The present participle can replace any active tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Trucks<span class=\"strong\"> driving across the bridge</span> have to pay a toll.</span><br/>(Trucks that drive across the bridge have to pay a toll.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Who was the boy <span class=\"strong\">wearing the blue cap</span>?</span><br/>(Who was the boy who was wearing the blue cap?)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Students <span class=\"strong\">handing in assignments early </span>get bonus points.</span><br/>(Students who hand in their assignments early get bonus points.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A young dreamer living in the village had fallen in love with the prized maiden.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "One day, the young man dreaming of marriage, gathered up all his courage.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Peeking through the clouds, the son of Moon and Sun caught sight of the unhappy young man sleeping. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "After performing this ritual four times, Sun led Scarface out of the lodge.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "scar", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a \u200bmark \u200bleft on \u200bpart of the \u200bbody after an \u200binjury, such as a \u200bcut, has \u200bhealed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He also had scars on his face and was known as Scarface.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about different cultures.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "beadwork", "type": "name"}, {"content": "jewelry or clothing with beads sewn on", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  When he got to her tent, the girl was doing beadwork. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sweat lodge", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a hut used for purification before prayers or religious events", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Morning Star built a sweat lodge. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to stammer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200bspeak or say something with \u200bunusual \u200bpauses or \u200brepeated\u200b sounds", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: \"Oh, beautiful maiden, will you have me for your husband?\" he stammered.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to catch sight of", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200bsee something only for a \u200bmoment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peeking through the clouds, the son of Moon and Sun caught sight of the unhappy young man. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "eyelid", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the two \u200bpieces of \u200bskin that can \u200bclose over each \u200beye", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Lonely and exhausted, he curled up on the ground and let his eyelids close.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "prized", "type": "name"}, {"content": "valued", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A young dreamer living in the village had fallen in love with the prized maiden.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "maiden", "type": "name"}, {"content": "young, unmarried woman", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He wanted to marry the beautiful maiden.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to chant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200brepeat or \u200bsing a word or phrase \u200bcontinuously", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sun chanted a prayer and cleansed the boy's face.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "On the Internet or at the library, research the North American sweat lodge.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out why natives build sweat lodges and what the different uses for them are.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out if the indigenous people in your country use something similar.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 3-4 paragraphs about the sweat lodge.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your information to a group.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research North American sweat lodges.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I research similar structures in my own country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about different cultures.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a report about my research.", "type": "text"}]}]}